.094118 .145098 .196078 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 46 Tm /F1 10 Tf 14 TL (Identify frames containing staff and locate their XY coordinates in overhead video. The staff name tag defines) Tj T* (the Staff class. This solution uses the project's trained YOLO26n best.pt checkpoint with the existing) Tj T* (ByteTrack configuration. The model predicts whole-person Staff boxes from learned examples; it does not) Tj T* (separately detect or read the tag. Tracking associates detections over time and assigns IDs.) Tj T* ET
