.094118 .145098 .196078 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 46 Tm /F1 10 Tf 14 TL (The supplied sample.mp4 has 1,341 frames at 25 FPS and 960 x 720 pixels. dataset_create.py extracts every) Tj T* (fifth frame, producing 269 images. parse_ndjson.py converts original split NDJSON annotations to YOLO) Tj T* (labels. The dataset has 215 training images with 48 Staff boxes and 54 validation images with 11 Staff boxes.) Tj T* (Other images have empty labels according to the original annotations.) Tj T* ET
Q
