q
.094118 .145098 .196078 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 46 Tm /F1 10 Tf 14 TL (Use the existing dataset/train and dataset/val labels. Image frame_NNNN.jpg maps to one-based video frame) Tj T* -0.123789 Tw (5 x NNNN + 1; image 0063 therefore maps to frame 316. Intermediate frames are unlabelled, not automatically) Tj T* 0 Tw (staff-absent. Class-and-box labels do not contain person identities, so they cannot establish ID-switch) Tj T* (accuracy.) Tj T* ET
