.094118 .145098 .196078 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 46 Tm /F1 10 Tf 14 TL -0.034496 Tw (The saved model was trained for 50 epochs, at image size 640 and batch size 4, with GPU 0 and two workers.) Tj T* 0 Tw (The current optional training script is train.py; yolo26n.yaml specifies dataset paths and the Staff class.) Tj T* (Despite its filename, this is a dataset configuration, not a model architecture. Tracking loads existing best.pt) Tj T* (weights and requires no retraining.) Tj T* ET
